Depends: python3, python3-pil, python3-numpy, fonts-dejavu-core
Recommends: alsa-utils
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/subnetsmith/cardputer-nearby
Description: Swap profile cards and wave at CardputerZeros close by
 Each CardputerZero running Nearby carries a small profile card (nickname,
 colour, status, 16x16 avatar). Walk past someone else running it and you swap
 cards automatically, even with the app closed. Wave at people around you with
 a short message. Everything is sent in the open over Bluetooth LE; a
 listen-only switch hides you.
